+      !tooltip: tr('When checked, walking by a click on the map or the minimap, or by\nkeys, keeps your attack target: you walk the path you chose and your\nattacks keep firing whenever the target is in range, even with Chase\nOpponent on. Chasing starts again when you stop. Unchecked, each step\ndelays your attacks and Chase Opponent pulls you back to the target.')
+
